        "created_at": "2018-04-18T05:58:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I thought you guys might want links to some of the sounds used in the video game for when damage is dealt*. &nbsp;Warning- some of these links are loud and others (looking at you, toxic damage) might be too sweary for work and/or small children. &nbsp;Click at your own Riske. &nbsp;No, seriously, find Setback and just follow him from 20 feet away, clicking. &nbsp;It’ll be funny.</p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=dNQs_Bef_V8\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Melee</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=XlLbsTP0C_U\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Projectile</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=CwNsXwRMI7s\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Toxic</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=TLvzNSfZ6v8\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Fire</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=Rj0Tj8dnrYw\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Energy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=kz44bT0Xdzw\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Cold</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=2FNVfEYywmA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Lightning</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=f38LBaiuX7c\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Psychic</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=OSCiMbMVDLI\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Infernal</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=Y966ZoY2CC0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Radiant</a></p><p><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=_asNhzXq72w\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sonic</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*I lied. &nbsp;These are all bad jokes, and all the links are to random YouTube videos. &nbsp;My sense of humor is not sponsored in any way by Greater than Games, Handelabra Games, or Jean-Marc Giffin (or his animalverse counterpart, Jean-Marc Gryphon).</p>",
