        "raw": "<p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I thought you guys might want links to some of the sounds used in the video game for when damage is dealt*. &nbsp;Warning- some of these links are loud and others (looking at you, toxic damage) might be too sweary for work and/or small children. &nbsp;Click at your own Riske. &nbsp;No, seriously, find Setback and just follow him from 20 feet away, clicking. &nbsp;It&rsquo;ll be funny.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=dNQs_Bef_V8\">Melee</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=XlLbsTP0C_U\">Projectile</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=CwNsXwRMI7s\">Toxic</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=TLvzNSfZ6v8\">Fire</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=Rj0Tj8dnrYw\">Energy</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=kz44bT0Xdzw\">Cold</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=2FNVfEYywmA\">Lightning</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=f38LBaiuX7c\">Psychic</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=OSCiMbMVDLI\">Infernal</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=Y966ZoY2CC0\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Radiant</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><a href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=_asNhzXq72w\">Sonic</a></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px;\">*I lied. &nbsp;These are all bad jokes, and all the links are to random YouTube videos. &nbsp;My sense of humor is not sponsored in any way by Greater than Games, Handelabra Games, or Jean-Marc Giffin (or his animalverse counterpart, Jean-Marc Gryphon).</p>",
